<title>UK: ABN AMRO sets warrants on French bank basket.</title>
<headline>ABN AMRO sets warrants on French bank basket.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>ABN AMRO Bank NV has issued 400,000 American-style call warrants on a basket of French banks, lead manager ABN AMRO Finance SA said.</p>
<p>The basket contains shares of Banque Nationale de Paris, Paribas, Compagnie Bancaire, Credit National and CLF - Dexia France. One basket is controlled by 100 warrants.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE    38,000 FFR		ISSUE PRICE  42.10 FFR</p>
<p> EXERCISE PERIOD 16.APR.97-30.MAR.99   PAYDATE	16.APR.97</p>
<p> LISTING	   PARIS		     MIN EXER LOT 1,000</p>
<p>--Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
